Package: scratch-link
Version: 0.1-0.3.0b1-sch-scripts
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, bluez, dbus, libnss3-tools, pipx
Maintainer: Grigoris Markakis <grigoris.pe86@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/grigoris-pe86/scratch-link
Description: A script that downloads and installs version 0.3.0b1 of Scratch Link
 Bleak (https://github.com/rril/scratch-link-bleak), an “unofficial, experimental
 Scratch Link  BLE bridge for Linux using Bleak (BlueZ/D-Bus)”. Scratch Link helper
 application for Bluetooth Low Energy (BLE) running as normal user.
 Includes the /usr/bin/scratch-link management wrapper.
